Package: autoruns
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Sysinternals <syssite@microsoft.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/microsoft/Autoruns-for-Linux
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1
Description: Sysinternals autorun and persistence entry utility
 Autoruns is a command-line utility that reports programs, scripts,
 services, timers, and other persistence hooks configured to run
 automatically on Linux systems.
License: MIT
